<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Kolosus 12-month net income EPS falls.</title>
<headline>Kolosus 12-month net income EPS falls.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interim results for twelve months ended May 31 1997.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>- on net operating</p>
<p>    income		    30.48	 vs    70.33</p>
<p>    - on net income	 12.61	 vs    23.33</p>
<p>    Net income		 7.57	 vs    14.00</p>
<p>    Operating income     101.18	 vs    82.50</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   22.87	 vs    41.81</p>
<p>    Tax			  -	    vs     0.17</p>
<p>    Turnover	     2,086.53	 vs 1,808.55</p>
<p>Full name: Kolosus Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - In view of the group's current gearing the board has decided not to declare a further interim dividend.</p>
<p>The group also said the board had decided to change the group's financial year-end to September 30.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
